$ Synthetic run deck for the force, stress and strain result types (tests/test_element_results.py).
$ One element of each family the types cover; the results are synthesized by
$ tests/op2_fixture.py (make_element_op2) and tests/h5_fixture.py (write_element_h5).
$   Shells:     CQUAD4 1, CTRIA3 2, CQUAD4 3 (PCOMP: composite)
$   Solids:     CHEXA 11
$   Lines:      CBAR 21, CBEAM 22, CROD 23
$   Bushes:     CBUSH 31 (GA-GB), CBUSH 32 (grounded)
$   Connectors: CELAS1 41, CELAS2 42, MPC set 41 (its legs carry EID 41 too: no spring force there)
